        #0gOr3GBilQaVlWvwE0Uidj ^"Harnessed Anger" DEF { ^"Effect" STRING "Once per round, Azusa may receive 3 strife to treat the deadliness of her readied weapon as 3 higher. Azusa loses this ability if she both learns to overcome her injury and reconciles with Jikai." }
    }

