            ^"Advantages" LIST OF STRING ["Wood and Stone — Martial; Physical"]
            ^"Disadvantages" LIST OF STRING ["Quick to Attack — Social; Mental"]
            ^"Favored Weapons" LIST OF STRING ["Tiger Teeth: Range 0, Damage 6, Deadliness 9, Razor-Edged", "Water Torrent: Range 0–3, Damage 5, Deadliness 7"]
